  "notes": "{起訴|きそ}する means to indict or prosecute someone in a legal context.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜で{起訴|きそ}される: to be indicted for\n- 〜を{起訴|きそ}する: to indict (someone)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {起訴|きそ}: indictment, prosecution (noun)\n- {不起訴|ふきそ}: non-prosecution, dropping charges\n- {起訴猶予|きそゆうよ}: suspended prosecution\n- {検察|けんさつ}: prosecution\n- {被告|ひこく}: defendant\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{起訴|きそ}する / 〜で{起訴|きそ}される",
